# Track only durable artifacts (mirrors Conjuguer's corpus policy).
# Source originals are large and re-fetchable; regenerable intermediates are rebuilt by scripts.
originals/
working/*.md
working/forms*.json
working/*_index.json
working/shards/
working/mined_*.json
# ...but always keep the tracked build scripts and finished/hand-built artifacts:
!working/*.py
!working/*.js
